## Tower Entry

The Masked Girl's voice reaches them before the door opens all the way.

**Masked Girl:** *"Welcome back, dearest climbers. Floor 5 is a little different from what you've seen so far."*

*[Pause. She sounds like she's choosing her next words carefully.]*

*"You are not the hunters this time. Something small lives in these tunnels — something that should not be caught. Five very old, very dangerous things are looking for it, and they have been looking for a long time.*

*"Your task is simple: keep it alive. Find it. Shield it. Or, if you're feeling ambitious — remove what's hunting it.*

*"I will note that all four parties on this floor share the same failure condition. This is the first floor where that is true.*

*"Good luck. You're going to want it. ♪"*

*[She steps aside.]*

