## Mountslayer Equipment

Mountslayer gear is distributed across the maze in specific high-value rooms (DM places 3 pieces before the session). Each piece is a one-use weapon that destroys a mount in a single hit — bypassing all HP and resistances.

| Item | Form | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Mountslayer Spear | One-handed spear, glows faintly silver | Single use; shatters on impact. The hit automatically dismounts the rider and kills the mount regardless of current HP. Must be a melee attack. |
| Mountslayer Bolt | Crossbow bolt, black iron tip | Single use; fired from any crossbow. Same effect as Spear but ranged (range 80ft). |
| Mountslayer Dust | Vial, thrown | 15ft range, thrown as an action. On contact with a mount, the mount makes a DC 18 Con save or instantly dies. On a success the mount takes 8d10 damage instead. |

**Finding Mountslayer gear:** These items are never in normal random rooms. They are always in rooms that have a special marker (DM places three ★ symbols on the map before play). Players reaching those rooms always find the gear regardless of their room content roll.

