## VICTORY CONDITIONS & PRIZES

**Floor Clears When:** Either all five Horsemen are defeated/dismounted simultaneously, OR Lumis survives until it completes 3 full circuits of the maze (approximately 270 minutes of floor time), whichever comes first.

**Floor Fails When:** Lumis reaches 0 HP.

