|---|---|---|
| **1st Place** | Party that dealt the killing blow or final dismount to the most Horsemen | +1 Armor (any type) AND +1 Weapon (any type) — both unidentified |
| **2nd Place** | Party with the second-most Horseman contributions | +1 Armor (any type) — unidentified |
| **3rd Place and beyond** | Any party that contributed at least 1 Horseman defeat or used a Weakness mechanic successfully | +1 Weapon (any type) — unidentified |

**Bonus Points** *(each grants a separate unidentified item, DM selects rarity)*:
